        {
          "evidence_pointer": "/current_source_evidence/cnn_global",
          "quote": "`AdaptiveAvgPool2d(1)` 則要求每通道最後只剩 1×1，本例把全部 16 個值平均成 `8.5`，不再保留四區的位置。",
          "page_id": "19.21",
          "evidence_origin": "retained_from_v1; not newly read in v2"
        },
        {
          "evidence_pointer": "/current_source_evidence/cnn_mapping",
          "quote": "`Flatten` 只把八個 1×1 攤成八格；`Linear(8,12)` 再學十二組「八格加權和＋偏置」，接上融合所用的 12 維。",
