          "evidence_origin": "retained_from_v1; not newly read in v2"
        },
        {
          "evidence_pointer": "/current_source_evidence/cnn_scope",
          "quote": "以下 `TinyAV` 是完整 CPU 機制例，沒有載入舊 A 或正式新權重。",
          "page_id": "19.21",
          "evidence_origin": "retained_from_v1; not newly read in v2"
        }
      ],
      "reasons_by_page": [
        {
          "page_id": "19.21",
          "reason": "舊CNN必要操作缺口仍已修好。Conv通道/3×3共享乘加/bias/pad先有文字，4×4人工kernel與兩種pool有完整程式及可手算輸出；兩種平均保留/失去哪些區域也交代。第二Conv的4×9=36輸入、8通道全圖平均、Flatten及8→12線性映射與完整形狀表/視覺trace能連到當前TinyAV.vision，沒有回退成只列API。",
          "verification_mode": "retained_from_v1"
